<Site title="Terms" description="Using Counted election results and address search."><div class="page-top page-share-heading"><h1>Terms</h1><PageShare/></div><section class="card"><p>Counted is an independent civic project. Election figures remain provisional unless the source explicitly declares otherwise. Read each result’s scope, source and timestamp before relying on it.</p><p>Address search uses Google Maps. By using it, you agree to the <a href="https://maps.google.com/help/terms_maps/">Google Maps/Google Earth Additional Terms of Service</a>. Google’s <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> also applies.</p><p>A geographic ward match does not confirm your registration or where you must vote. Check those details with the <a href="https://registertovote.elections.org.za/">IEC</a>. Boundaries and approximate map pins may differ; the IEC is the authority for registration and official results.</p><p>Public data retains its source attribution and any applicable source terms. Google place information is not part of Counted’s downloadable election dataset.</p></section></Site>
